### BookStore API Test Collection
### Base URL Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@baseUrlLab = http://localhost:8080/lab
@contentType = application/json

###
### ============================================
### AUTHOR ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Create Author 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "George R. R. Martin",
  "nationality": "American"
}

### Create Author 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "J.K. Rowling",
  "nationality": "British"
}

### Create Author 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Stephen King",
  "nationality": "American"
}

### Get All Authors
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get Author by ID (replace 1 with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Update Author (replace 1 with actual ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/authors/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "George Raymond Richard Martin",
  "nationality": "United States"
}

### Delete Author (replace 1 with actual ID after testing)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/authors/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ============================================
### BOOK ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Create Book 1 (requires authorId 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "A Game of Thrones",
  "isbn": "978-0553103540",
  "price": 15.99,
  "publishedYear": 1996,
  "authorId": 1
}

### Create Book 2 (requires authorId 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "A Clash of Kings",
  "isbn": "978-0553108032",
  "price": 16.99,
  "publishedYear": 1998,
  "authorId": 1
}

### Create Book 3 (requires authorId 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone",
  "isbn": "978-0747532699",
  "price": 12.99,
  "publishedYear": 1997,
  "authorId": 2
}

### Create Book 4 (requires authorId 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets",
  "isbn": "978-0747538494",
  "price": 13.99,
  "publishedYear": 1998,
  "authorId": 2
}

### Create Book 5 (requires authorId 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "The Shining",
  "isbn": "978-0385333312",
  "price": 9.99,
  "publishedYear": 1977,
  "authorId": 3
}

### Create Book using create-book endpoint
POST {{baseUrlLab}}/create-book
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "The Shining",
  "isbn": "978-0385333312",
  "price": 9.99,
  "publishedYear": 1977,
  "authorId": 3
}


### Get All Books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get Book by ID (replace 1 with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Update Book (replace 1 with actual ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "A Game of Thrones (Special Edition)",
  "isbn": "978-0553103540",
  "price": 18.99,
  "publishedYear": 1996,
  "authorId": 1
}

### Delete Book (replace 1 with actual ID after testing)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ============================================
### DEMO ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Virtual Thread Demo
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/virtual-thread
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ============================================
### ERROR TEST CASES
### ============================================

### Create Author - Invalid Request (missing field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Test Author"
}

### Create Book - Invalid Request (missing authorId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "isbn": "978-0000000000",
  "price": 10.00,
  "publishedYear": 2024
}

### Create Book - Invalid Price (negative)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Test Book",
  "isbn": "978-0000000000",
  "price": -5.00,
  "publishedYear": 2024,
  "authorId": 1
}

### Get Non-existent Author
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get Non-existent Book
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### ============================================
### USAGE NOTES
### ============================================
### 1. Replace IDs (1, 2, 3, etc.) with actual IDs from create responses
### 2. Execute "Create Author" endpoints first to get valid author IDs
### 3. Use the returned author IDs when creating books
### 4. Test error cases after successful CRUD operations
### 5. The Virtual Thread Demo endpoint may take ~1.25 seconds to complete
